{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"agent_message","text":"The fast probe reproduced the two major five-band transitions, the column-7 passage (+2), and the first support removal (+1). It also falsified the brief’s tentative final ordering: clicking the centered color-15 cell after that first support does not prevent death on the next support. I’m narrowing the remaining ambiguity to the hazard’s shape/timing by comparing its cell area before and after clicks in adjacent contexts."}}
